  "answer_text": "## Spiegel Catalog \u2014 What You Need to Know in 2026\n\n### \ud83d\uded1 Is Spiegel Still Active?\n\nUnfortunately, the Spiegel catalog and online store are **no longer operating**. Spiegel ran from 1865 to roughly 2019, when the brand quietly went dark under Patriarch Partners. According to archived references, the company abruptly ceased operations during the winter of 2019\u20132020. The website came down with no farewell letter, no closeout sale, and no press release of any consequence.\n\nAs of early 2026, spiegel.com does not resolve to a working storefront. There is no Spiegel print catalog being mailed in the United States, and no credible news of a brand revival, a buyer, or a relaunch could be found.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcd6 A Brief History of Spiegel\n\n- Spiegel was an American direct marketing retailer founded in 1865 by Joseph Spiegel. Spiegel published a catalog \u2014 like its competitors Sears, Aldens, and Montgomery Ward \u2014 which advertised various brands of apparel, accessories, and footwear, as well as housewares, toys, tools, and electronics.\n- Spiegel delivered its first mail-order catalog in 1905, and by 1925, the retailer had 10 million customers.\n- After encountering financial difficulty in the early 2000s, the company was purchased by Patriarch Partners and focused on women's style and fashion products. The catalog was eventually discontinued in favor of digital marketing.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Where to Find Spiegel Items Now\n\nIf you're looking for Spiegel products or catalogs today, here are your best options:\n\n1. **eBay** \u2014 Vintage Spiegel clothing turns up regularly on resale sites, and there is a small collector market for the older catalogs themselves on eBay.\n2. **Etsy** \u2014 Vintage Spiegel catalogs such as *Spiegel 1970 Fall/Winter Fashion Vintage Catalog* are available on Etsy.\n3. **Similar Retailers** \u2014 Talbots, Soft Surroundings, Appleseed's, and Roaman's are all still operating and still mailing print books in 2026.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Summary\n\n| Feature | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Spiegel Online Store | \u274c Closed (~2019\u20132020) |\n| Print Catalog | \u274c No longer mailed |\n| Brand Revival | \u274c None confirmed as of 2026 |\n| Vintage Items | \u2705 Available on eBay & Etsy |\n\nIf you're looking for a **similar home or fashion catalog shopping experience**, I'd recommend checking out **Talbots**, **Soft Surroundings**, or **Roaman's** as solid alternatives!",
